---
// Online HTML-to-Markdown converter (BL-62). The logic is src/scripts/converter.ts; the engine is
// '@page2ai/core/html' in a Web Worker (src/scripts/convert.worker.ts). Nothing here sends the HTML anywhere.
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
const cws =
  'https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/dlpaaijcnbbmlfeohlphjpnbbcnomnno?utm_source=page2ai-docs&utm_medium=converter&utm_campaign=online-converter';
---

<div class="p2a not-content" id="p2a-conv">
  <div class="p2a-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Input" id="p2a-in-tabs">
    <button type="button" role="tab" id="p2a-tab-upload" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="p2a-panel-upload">Upload a file</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" id="p2a-tab-paste" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p2a-panel-paste" tabindex="-1">Paste HTML</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" id="p2a-tab-url" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p2a-panel-url" tabindex="-1">From a link</button>
  </div>

  <div role="tabpanel" id="p2a-panel-upload" aria-labelledby="p2a-tab-upload" class="p2a-panel">
    <label class="p2a-drop" id="p2a-drop">
      <input type="file" id="p2a-file" accept=".html,.htm,.xhtml,.shtml,text/html,application/xhtml+xml" />
      <span class="p2a-drop-main">Choose an .html file or drop it here</span>
      <span class="p2a-hint">A page saved with Ctrl+S (Cmd+S on a Mac), up to <span id="p2a-limit">10 MB</span></span>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div role="tabpanel" id="p2a-panel-paste" aria-labelledby="p2a-tab-paste" class="p2a-panel" hidden>
    <textarea
      id="p2a-html"
      rows="9"
      spellcheck="false"
      autocomplete="off"
      aria-label="HTML to convert"
      placeholder="Paste the page's HTML here. Ctrl+U in Chrome shows the source of the page you are on."></textarea>
    <div class="p2a-row">
      <button type="button" id="p2a-convert-paste" class="p2a-btn p2a-primary">Convert to Markdown</button>
      <span class="p2a-hint">or Ctrl+Enter</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div role="tabpanel" id="p2a-panel-url" aria-labelledby="p2a-tab-url" class="p2a-panel" hidden>
    <input type="url" id="p2a-url" class="p2a-input" placeholder="https://example.com/article" aria-label="Page link" />
    <p>
      This page converts files in your browser and does not fetch links: a browser does not let one site read
      another site's HTML. To convert a page from its link:
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>
        Open it, press Ctrl+S (Cmd+S on a Mac) and upload the saved .html file in the first tab. Set the link as the
        page address, so relative links resolve.
      </li>
      <li>
        Or add the free <a href={cws}>Chrome extension</a>: one click converts the page you are reading, including
        pages behind a sign-in and pages that scripts build.
      </li>
      <li>AI agents: the <a href={`${base}mcp/`}>MCP server</a> fetches by URL, <code>npx -y page2ai-mcp</code>.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="p2a-row">
      <a id="p2a-url-open" class="p2a-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Open the page ↗</a>
      <button type="button" id="p2a-url-base" class="p2a-btn">Use as page address</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <details class="p2a-opts" id="p2a-opts">
    <summary>Options</summary>
    <label class="p2a-field">
      <span>Page address (resolves relative links; found in the file when it names one)</span>
      <input type="url" id="p2a-base" class="p2a-input" placeholder="https://example.com/page" />
    </label>
    <label class="p2a-check"><input type="checkbox" id="p2a-fm" checked /> Frontmatter (title, source, date)</label>
    <label class="p2a-check"><input type="checkbox" id="p2a-img" checked /> Images</label>
  </details>

  <p class="p2a-private">
    🔒 Converted in this browser tab by <code>@page2ai/core</code>, the engine of the Page2AI MCP server. No request
    carries your file: open DevTools → Network, let this page finish loading, then convert one; no request appears.
  </p>

  <p id="p2a-status" class="p2a-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <section id="p2a-out" class="p2a-out" hidden aria-label="Result">
    <div class="p2a-outbar">
      <div class="p2a-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Result view" id="p2a-out-tabs">
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="p2a-tab-md" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="p2a-panel-md">Markdown</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="p2a-tab-preview" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="p2a-panel-preview" tabindex="-1">Preview</button>
      </div>
      <div class="p2a-row">
        <button type="button" id="p2a-copy" class="p2a-btn">Copy</button>
        <button type="button" id="p2a-download" class="p2a-btn p2a-primary">Download .md</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p id="p2a-stats" class="p2a-hint"></p>
    <p id="p2a-base-note" class="p2a-hint"></p>
    <div id="p2a-empty" class="p2a-note" hidden>
      This file has no readable body text. Pages that build their text with scripts, or show it only after a sign-in,
      often save this way. The <a href={cws}>Chrome extension</a> reads the page in your own tab, after its scripts ran
      and with your sign-in.
    </div>
    <div role="tabpanel" id="p2a-panel-md" aria-labelledby="p2a-tab-md">
      <textarea id="p2a-md" readonly spellcheck="false" aria-label="Markdown"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div role="tabpanel" id="p2a-panel-preview" aria-labelledby="p2a-tab-preview" hidden>
      <label class="p2a-check">
        <input type="checkbox" id="p2a-loadimg" /> Load images (their sites see your IP address)
      </label>
      <iframe
        id="p2a-frame"
        title="Rendered Markdown"
        sandbox="allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
        loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="p2a-cta">
      <strong>Like the result?</strong> Get it from any page you read, in one click:
      <a class="p2a-btn p2a-primary" href={cws}>Add to Chrome (free)</a>
      <a class="p2a-btn" href={`${base}mcp/`}>MCP server for AI agents</a>
      <a class="p2a-btn" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@page2ai/core">npm library</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
  import '../scripts/converter.ts';
</script>

<style>
  .p2a {
    --p2a-line: var(--sl-color-hairline-light, #d0d4da);
    --p2a-soft: var(--sl-color-gray-6, #f3f4f6);
    margin-block: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .p2a code {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    font-size: 0.875em;
  }
  .p2a-tabs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--p2a-line);
  }
  .p2a-tabs [role='tab'] {
    font: inherit;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: none;
    border-radius: 0.4rem 0.4rem 0 0;
    background: none;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3, inherit);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .p2a-tabs [role='tab'][aria-selected='true'] {
    border-color: var(--p2a-line);
    background: var(--sl-color-bg, #fff);
    color: var(--sl-color-white, inherit);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: -1px;
  }
  .p2a-panel p,
  .p2a-panel ol {
    margin: 0.6rem 0;
  }
  .p2a-drop {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 1rem;
    border: 2px dashed var(--p2a-line);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    text-align: center;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .p2a-drop[data-over],
  .p2a-drop:hover {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent, #4f46e5);
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low, transparent);
  }
  .p2a-drop input {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .p2a-drop:focus-within {
    outline: 2px solid var(--sl-color-accent, #4f46e5);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .p2a-drop-main {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .p2a-hint {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3, #6b7280);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .p2a textarea,
  .p2a-input {
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--p2a-line);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg, #fff);
    color: var(--sl-color-white, inherit);
  }
  #p2a-md {
    min-height: 22rem;
    resize: vertical;
  }
  #p2a-frame {
    width: 100%;
    height: 32rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--p2a-line);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    background: #fff;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .p2a-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .p2a-btn {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--p2a-line);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg, #fff);
    color: var(--sl-color-white, inherit);
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .p2a-btn[aria-disabled] {
    opacity: 0.5;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .p2a-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.6;
    cursor: progress;
  }
  .p2a-primary {
    background: var(--sl-color-accent, #4f46e5);
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent, #4f46e5);
    color: var(--sl-color-black, #fff);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .p2a-opts summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .p2a-field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .p2a-check {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-right: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .p2a-private {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .p2a-status {
    min-height: 1.4em;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .p2a-status[data-kind='error'] {
    color: var(--sl-color-red, #b91c1c);
  }
  .p2a-out {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .p2a-out[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .p2a-outbar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .p2a-outbar .p2a-tabs {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }
  .p2a-outbar .p2a-row {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }
  .p2a-note,
  .p2a-cta {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--p2a-line);
    background: var(--p2a-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .p2a-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
